{"id":"b2f39aba43091cc3","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-jones-polynomial.md","title":"Jones Polynomial","display":"df-jones-polynomial — Jones Polynomial","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-jones-polynomial","aliases":["58-df-jones-polynomial"],"display":"df-jones-polynomial — Jones Polynomial","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-bracket-polynomial.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-jones-polynomial"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-jones-polynomial</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jones-polynomial — Jones Polynomial"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d43649881d4bfbbd\" href=\"?note=d43649881d4bfbbd\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-bracket-polynomial.md\">../batch08/58-df-bracket-polynomial.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md\">../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> (oriented link diagram)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w(D)\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(w(D)\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span> (writhe of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle D\\rangle_A\\in\\mathbb Z[A,A^{-1}]\">\\(\\langle D\\rangle_A\\in\\mathbb Z[A,A^{-1}]\\)</span> (Kauffman bracket)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_D(t)\">\\(V_D(t)\\)</span> (normalized Jones polynomial of the diagram defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jones\\text{-}polynomial} \\vdash V_D(t) \\coloneqq \\bigl[(-A^3)^{-w(D)}\\langle D\\rangle_A\\bigr]_{A=t^{-1/4}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jones\\text{-}polynomial} \\vdash V_D(t) \\coloneqq \\bigl[(-A^3)^{-w(D)}\\langle D\\rangle_A\\bigr]_{A=t^{-1/4}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jones polynomial is a Laurent polynomial in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Z}[t^{-1/2}, t^{1/2}]\">\\(\\mathbb{Z}[t^{-1/2}, t^{1/2}]\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The writhe correction converts regular-isotopy invariance of the bracket into ambient-isotopy invariance; the theorem that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_D\">\\(V_D\\)</span> depends only on the represented oriented link justifies the customary notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_L\">\\(V_L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>With <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{\\bigcirc}(t)=1\">\\(V_{\\bigcirc}(t)=1\\)</span>, the corresponding skein relation is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^{-1}V_{L_+}-tV_{L_-}=(t^{1/2}-t^{-1/2})V_{L_0}\">\\(t^{-1}V_{L_+}-tV_{L_-}=(t^{1/2}-t^{-1/2})V_{L_0}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Leads to Khovanov homology (categorification).</li>\n<li>Hecke algebras give same skein relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-bracket-polynomial.md","status":"resolved","id":"d43649881d4bfbbd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-bracket-polynomial.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"w(D)\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle D\\rangle_A\\in\\mathbb Z[A,A^{-1}]","display":false},{"tex":"V_D(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jones\\text{-}polynomial} \\vdash V_D(t) \\coloneqq \\bigl[(-A^3)^{-w(D)}\\langle D\\rangle_A\\bigr]_{A=t^{-1/4}}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Z}[t^{-1/2}, t^{1/2}]","display":false},{"tex":"V_D","display":false},{"tex":"V_L","display":false},{"tex":"V_{\\bigcirc}(t)=1","display":false},{"tex":"t^{-1}V_{L_+}-tV_{L_-}=(t^{1/2}-t^{-1/2})V_{L_0}","display":false}],"bytes":1209,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-720","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-jones-polynomial.md|58-df-jones-polynomial]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d43649881d4bfbbd","ab5e359a8ea0dcb4"]}